<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-07T08:59:25.907Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 08:59:25 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Somalia's Supreme Court declared President Hassan Sheikh Mohamud's term extension unlawful, prompting political uncertainty while al-Shabaab intensified attacks, including a suspected assault on a police station and camp in Garissa and a warning that Houthi support could boost its capabilities. Uganda announced its withdrawal of troops by 2027, with peacekeepers moving into bases near the capital as Ugandan forces leave, and the United States has vacated the strategic Baledogle airfield after more than a decade of use. Turkey is reported to be considering a takeover of the vacated airfield, adding a new external actor to the security landscape. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE1SVFpORU5zQkRLVkp2OWNJWGplQWhXeFE5NkN4UXpOSGtzaVZNUzBfRXZ5cUxKMDliWGZ6a2I3bVMyRko4MlphZmpPdXgyVnRRcHlwdF96ZmxLems?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNQzRTTFlYakw2WUUybFk0OWdoMzVxbHR3ckFLbVVnb21DRmJOenFVb3ZSS3lDWDlvTXZuUG9fOFcyN3JrUko0MERUMWVwTXRTQm9qUjcxRk1xaWNqbENuSmpEeS1MQzhLWmpiaXRsU2U4ZFhiWnFjbGtCbEtjSENOS3h1b1hJdW5RR3BvcWRBUVVlLXhNNzRocEtoTFRGM1BuaDVSc3lvdTltdk1lT0VQU1ZjOWRsQ2U4YkUyU2FfSldCZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kahawatungu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxPQXNtMXpfcnJ6YVlnVXFJSnhHSzBOYVA2TjRMM2xIeG1rakZESUJmRHdvTUdmVVdvOThhdkUtYUZXNlFZVlNvWWoweHNEVnhvdFBXN3hkU0JOakxBb0JVSkswUE4wcTcxUEo2MU1RYWdma3hENmhTdTR4UGEzNF9oa3hObXJ6SzRWbTMyX1FsdnhQWnV1ZzBGWmVxM285UVJMLTk1R0l5R0ZmZ2Q3eTNSeFRlcVpXUTc1aUFCNHJPM3ZTYlA3b19wYjFTaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE1RU1dYZF9JeVJlTnVkVG